WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.140 --> 01:37.946
=Episode 36=

01:41.160 --> 01:42.160
This is a restricted area.

01:42.160 --> 01:42.880
No unauthorized entry.

01:42.960 --> 01:43.960
(Imperial Decree)
All unrelated personnel,

01:44.080 --> 01:45.001
leave immediately.

01:45.720 --> 01:46.240
Search!

01:58.641 --> 02:00.641
(Grand Secretary Yu is finished.)

02:42.361 --> 02:43.241
Mr. Zhao is back.

02:45.961 --> 02:46.841
Mr. Zhao is back.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.160
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

03:14.521 --> 03:15.720
The entire household

03:16.720 --> 03:17.920
is intact.

04:00.720 --> 04:01.640
I'm back.

04:12.841 --> 04:13.841
I'm back.

04:14.121 --> 04:15.281
It's good to have you back.

04:20.549 --> 04:24.842
(Yu Residence)

04:42.721 --> 04:43.721
Did you bring it?

04:43.840 --> 04:44.320
Give it to me.

04:45.280 --> 04:45.960
Give it to me.

04:46.041 --> 04:47.121
No father harms his own child.

04:47.921 --> 04:49.681
Is this really the only way?

04:49.681 --> 04:51.080
Do you think I want this?

04:51.640 --> 04:53.520
Look at what has become
of the world outside!

04:53.760 --> 04:55.440
His Majesty is just waiting for a reason

04:55.601 --> 04:56.760
to confiscate our estate

04:56.760 --> 04:57.801
and fill the treasury.

04:58.280 --> 04:59.161
Now is the time

04:59.161 --> 05:02.121
to sacrifice a part to save the whole.

05:02.121 --> 05:03.001
Give it to me.

05:07.440 --> 05:08.121
Master,

05:08.280 --> 05:09.760
you must keep him alive.

05:09.760 --> 05:11.921
Please, you must keep him alive.

05:21.041 --> 05:21.760
Madam.

06:09.681 --> 06:10.280
Father.

06:14.280 --> 06:16.320
I never knew you liked Guangling Melody.

06:17.440 --> 06:18.561
I happen to have

06:18.561 --> 06:20.080
a fragment of Ji Kang's original score.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.080
Tomorrow,

06:21.960 --> 06:23.001
I will get it for you.

06:24.721 --> 06:26.200
But didn't you always disapprove

06:26.921 --> 06:28.880
of my indulgence in music?

06:29.561 --> 06:30.721
Why today...?

06:34.001 --> 06:35.601
A father and son share a bond.

06:36.121 --> 06:37.440
What you desire,

06:37.601 --> 06:40.400
I'll give it to you.

06:41.721 --> 06:42.561
Likewise,

06:44.640 --> 06:46.561
what I desire,

06:48.241 --> 06:49.400
Jingxiu,

06:49.801 --> 06:52.161
you must do your utmost to fulfill.

06:58.912 --> 06:59.687
(Confession)

06:59.694 --> 07:02.822
(Your Majesty, I, Yu Jingxiu,
stand guilty and await your judgment.)

07:08.121 --> 07:09.840
Father, you can't be serious.

07:11.960 --> 07:14.161
Every charge on this confession

07:15.960 --> 07:17.001
is a grave one.

07:17.601 --> 07:19.080
This means death.

07:22.520 --> 07:23.280
And besides,

07:25.001 --> 07:26.361
if I confess and sign,

07:27.880 --> 07:29.161
no one will believe it.

07:29.601 --> 07:30.601
Jingxiu,

07:31.601 --> 07:33.080
this is only a formality.

07:34.001 --> 07:35.241
His Majesty made his intentions clear

07:35.601 --> 07:37.760
in court today.

07:38.561 --> 07:40.721
He wants to fill the treasury

07:41.320 --> 07:43.001
by confiscating our assets.

07:43.721 --> 07:45.440
He allowed me to come home tonight

07:45.440 --> 07:46.960
precisely for this.

07:46.960 --> 07:48.960
Who confesses no longer matters.

07:50.880 --> 07:52.601
As for no one believing you...

07:54.520 --> 07:55.320
You served

07:55.320 --> 07:57.440
as a secretary
in the Ministry of Revenue.

07:57.440 --> 07:59.921
Your duty was auditing revenue
and expenditures,

07:59.921 --> 08:01.280
particularly the salt tax.

08:01.681 --> 08:03.001
It falls within your authority.

08:03.001 --> 08:04.320
It is only natural.

08:06.241 --> 08:07.121
In the end,

08:12.481 --> 08:14.520
you still want to discard me?

08:20.681 --> 08:21.960
Jingxiu,

08:22.080 --> 08:24.280
I have nowhere left to turn.

08:24.280 --> 08:26.561
I have no other choice.

08:26.561 --> 08:27.880
If you confess,

08:29.241 --> 08:31.280
I will do everything in my power

08:31.280 --> 08:32.441
to save your life.

08:33.040 --> 08:34.481
And I will leave you a foundation

08:34.481 --> 08:35.880
to rise again.

08:36.441 --> 08:37.481
But if I

08:38.001 --> 08:39.400
go to prison and face punishment,

08:39.481 --> 08:41.721
the Yu family will be finished.

08:42.760 --> 08:43.880
Jingxiu,

08:44.081 --> 08:46.520
you must think of the bigger picture.

08:52.640 --> 08:53.441
No!

08:53.841 --> 08:54.481
Jingxiu!

08:57.601 --> 08:58.441
Where are you running?

08:58.441 --> 08:59.441
Can you really escape?

09:04.920 --> 09:05.441
Father.

09:06.121 --> 09:07.680
There must be someone more suitable.

09:09.361 --> 09:10.400
What about Yu Huaian?

09:11.321 --> 09:12.081
Ms. Shu?

09:13.520 --> 09:14.361
Chengxin?

09:14.961 --> 09:16.121
He's been with me for years.

09:16.241 --> 09:17.121
I can convince him.

09:17.201 --> 09:18.880
You're too naive.

09:18.880 --> 09:21.081
Yu Huaian, Ms. Shu and Chengxin.

09:21.081 --> 09:22.201
They are all beneath us.

09:22.961 --> 09:24.280
Now we must offer up

09:24.280 --> 09:25.280
someone from the top

09:25.280 --> 09:26.560
to appease the people

09:26.560 --> 09:27.640
and uphold the Emperor's authority.

09:27.640 --> 09:28.201
Do you understand?

09:28.201 --> 09:29.001
I will find someone.

09:30.121 --> 09:31.081
I will find the right person.

09:31.081 --> 09:31.760
There's no time.

09:33.800 --> 09:34.321
Sign it.

09:36.800 --> 09:37.640
Father!

09:38.841 --> 09:39.880
Don't lie to me.

09:40.081 --> 09:41.400
You claim to love me,

09:41.760 --> 09:43.441
but you've always treated me
as a piece of meat

09:43.441 --> 09:44.800
to be devoured.

09:44.800 --> 09:46.601
What nonsense are you saying?

09:46.680 --> 09:47.121
You...

09:47.640 --> 09:48.081
You...

09:48.081 --> 09:49.481
Didn't you want to go to Ganlin Town?

09:50.280 --> 09:52.361
Sign the confession,

09:52.560 --> 09:55.441
and I will send you there
to keep you safe.

09:56.441 --> 09:56.920
No.

09:57.640 --> 09:58.520
I won't sign!

10:04.400 --> 10:05.560
Yu Guodong,

10:06.920 --> 10:07.961
if you do this,

10:09.800 --> 10:11.961
aren't you afraid
of breaking Mother's heart?

10:21.160 --> 10:21.680
Father.

10:22.040 --> 10:22.961
Father, what's wrong?

10:25.001 --> 10:25.560
Father?

10:26.280 --> 10:26.841
Father.

10:31.121 --> 10:31.560
Father.

10:31.961 --> 10:32.441
Father.

10:32.640 --> 10:33.800
Father, I didn't mean it.

10:34.201 --> 10:34.841
Father.

10:34.841 --> 10:36.160
I didn't mean it.

10:36.920 --> 10:39.080
(Qingli Hall of Learning)

10:39.920 --> 10:40.481
Father.

10:41.040 --> 10:41.560
Father.

10:48.080 --> 10:50.880
(Qingli Hall of Learning)

10:59.520 --> 11:00.841
You were forced by circumstances.

11:01.361 --> 11:03.081
Madam, you had no other choice.

11:03.601 --> 11:05.121
In ancient times, sons sacrificed
for their parents.

11:05.121 --> 11:06.241
They risked their lives to save them.

11:06.721 --> 11:08.441
Young Master is well-read.

11:08.520 --> 11:09.961
He knows what matters most.

11:32.961 --> 11:33.680
Young Master.

11:41.040 --> 11:41.721
Mother.

12:10.640 --> 12:11.520
Master.

12:11.961 --> 12:12.880
Master!

12:22.760 --> 12:24.241
What... what happened?

12:24.841 --> 12:26.081
What happened?

12:26.640 --> 12:27.760
What exactly happened?

12:29.321 --> 12:31.081
What happened? Tell me.

12:32.880 --> 12:33.560
Speak!

12:35.760 --> 12:36.560
Mother,

12:37.441 --> 12:38.321
it wasn't me.

12:39.481 --> 12:41.040
Father fell on his own.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.680
I didn't mean it.

12:44.760 --> 12:45.361
Mother.

12:47.920 --> 12:49.481
How could this happen?

12:49.721 --> 12:51.081
How could this happen?

12:51.160 --> 12:52.081
Master.

12:53.241 --> 12:54.680
Master!

12:58.201 --> 12:59.680
How could this happen?

12:59.680 --> 13:00.160
Mother.

13:01.441 --> 13:02.001
Mother.

13:04.121 --> 13:05.201
What's done is done.

13:06.241 --> 13:07.680
Killing one's father is a grave crime.

13:09.441 --> 13:10.961
Please save me, Mother.

13:15.241 --> 13:17.601
Why couldn't it have been you?

13:27.001 --> 13:29.121
So you had it all planned
from the start.

13:29.361 --> 13:31.081
The big fish eating the small one.

13:32.121 --> 13:33.321
But you didn't expect

13:33.560 --> 13:35.160
the small fish to survive.

13:38.121 --> 13:40.321
None of you wanted me.

13:41.481 --> 13:42.040
No...

13:46.361 --> 13:47.560
Fan is gone.

13:50.241 --> 13:51.481
Wu is gone too.

13:54.201 --> 13:55.680
Father wanted to discard me,

13:55.680 --> 13:56.841
and you went along with it.

13:59.280 --> 14:00.321
But Mother,

14:04.001 --> 14:06.280
I have disappointed you again.

14:12.640 --> 14:13.601
This time,

14:17.001 --> 14:18.321
no matter what,

14:19.560 --> 14:21.040
you have to help me.

14:52.961 --> 14:53.520
My Lord.

14:53.601 --> 14:54.441
We arrived too late.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.160
(Great Virtue Brings Fortune)

15:09.337 --> 15:10.643
(Your Majesty, I, Yu Guodong,
confess my crimes.)

15:10.656 --> 15:12.062
(My crimes are too numerous to count.
I deserve death.)

15:12.063 --> 15:13.010
(Yu Guodong's final words.)

15:13.040 --> 15:14.280
Suicide out of guilt?

15:16.481 --> 15:17.880
He would actually do it?

15:18.920 --> 15:20.081
Where are Madam Yu and Yu Jingxiu?

15:20.361 --> 15:20.920
Search.

15:21.760 --> 15:22.680
(Great Virtue Brings Fortune)
Last night,

15:22.920 --> 15:24.361
my late husband and my son

15:25.081 --> 15:26.560
had an argument.

15:27.160 --> 15:28.640
I did overhear

15:29.160 --> 15:30.441
something about "turn oneself in."

15:31.361 --> 15:33.040
I thought it was just normal affairs.

15:33.121 --> 15:34.321
I never expected that this morning,

15:34.800 --> 15:37.040
he would take his own life.

15:38.841 --> 15:39.961
(Boundless Longevity)
Yu Guodong

15:40.081 --> 15:41.680
has been corrupt for years.

15:41.680 --> 15:43.040
Did you and your son

15:43.880 --> 15:45.760
truly know nothing?

15:47.800 --> 15:49.361
He always made his own decisions.

15:49.520 --> 15:50.920
Even I, his wife,

15:51.601 --> 15:53.201
could barely see into his affairs.

15:54.520 --> 15:55.601
But yesterday,

15:59.321 --> 16:01.160
my son happened to discover something.

16:02.280 --> 16:02.920
I...

16:04.321 --> 16:06.121
I saw it with my own eyes last night.

16:06.481 --> 16:08.121
My father was meeting privately
with his protege.

16:09.920 --> 16:10.520
I had...

16:12.441 --> 16:13.361
I had intended

16:13.361 --> 16:15.081
to persuade him to turn back.

16:16.081 --> 16:17.081
But I never expected...

16:19.920 --> 16:20.920
As a court official,

16:23.241 --> 16:24.160
I could not bear

16:25.081 --> 16:26.760
to watch a top minister

16:27.040 --> 16:29.280
remain stubborn and harm the court.

16:30.640 --> 16:32.001
The law has no room for personal ties.

16:32.400 --> 16:33.121
This matter

16:33.481 --> 16:35.241
must be handled impartially

16:35.920 --> 16:37.241
to restore proper order.

16:39.640 --> 16:40.361
But

16:40.520 --> 16:42.160
he is still my father.

16:43.201 --> 16:44.841
Loyalty and filial piety
cannot both be fulfilled.

16:46.400 --> 16:48.081
If Your Majesty does not believe me,

16:48.640 --> 16:49.800
then let me

16:50.441 --> 16:51.920
(Boundless Longevity)
bear my father's punishment!

16:54.001 --> 16:55.160
I was foolish.

16:55.160 --> 16:56.760
I failed to notice sooner.

16:59.040 --> 17:00.560
My son exposed his own father

17:01.361 --> 17:03.280
and wanted to save him from ruin.

17:03.560 --> 17:06.360
But a son's heart is not made of stone.

17:07.481 --> 17:09.201
How could he not feel the pain?

17:10.600 --> 17:12.161
If the court must punish someone,

17:13.560 --> 17:14.600
Grand Empress Dowager,

17:15.641 --> 17:18.401
please, as a mother myself,

17:18.721 --> 17:19.760
let me

17:20.320 --> 17:22.280
bear the punishment for my son!

17:23.560 --> 17:24.120
Mother.

17:24.241 --> 17:25.760
Please, Your Majesty.

17:25.921 --> 17:26.401
Mother.

17:26.401 --> 17:28.040
Let me be punished!

17:28.721 --> 17:30.520
No, Mother. You must not.

17:36.360 --> 17:36.921
Mother.

17:42.520 --> 17:43.280
Enough.

17:44.481 --> 17:45.961
I understand everything now.

17:46.560 --> 17:47.921
The Emperor has always been

17:48.280 --> 17:49.681
fair in rewarding and punishing.

17:50.641 --> 17:52.360
He will give the Yu family

17:52.840 --> 17:53.961
a just outcome.

17:54.520 --> 17:55.681
I

17:57.161 --> 17:59.001
will abide by your decree.

18:04.001 --> 18:05.201
You may go.

18:06.921 --> 18:07.520
Mother.

18:34.721 --> 18:35.520
Your Majesty,

18:36.001 --> 18:37.120
what do you think?

18:40.280 --> 18:40.960
(Boundless Longevity)
They were all raised

18:40.960 --> 18:42.120
(Boundless Longevity)
on the people's blood and sweat.

18:42.800 --> 18:44.280
There's no such thing
as sacrificing kin for justice.

18:44.760 --> 18:46.241
It's just a desperate act,

18:46.401 --> 18:47.800
cutting off a limb to survive.

18:49.080 --> 18:50.641
Madam Yu

18:51.080 --> 18:52.760
is a sharp woman.

18:53.441 --> 18:54.881
If we spare her and her son,

18:55.560 --> 18:56.681
her money

18:56.840 --> 18:58.481
will be given up more willingly.

18:59.201 --> 19:01.560
If we leave her no way out,

19:01.840 --> 19:03.520
she may just put it all

19:03.520 --> 19:05.080
into the coffin.

19:05.721 --> 19:06.840
Yu Guodong

19:07.241 --> 19:08.881
is dead and can no longer speak.

19:09.201 --> 19:10.441
Confiscate his assets

19:11.280 --> 19:13.040
to serve as a warning.

19:13.600 --> 19:14.481
In the future,

19:14.681 --> 19:16.721
officials should take this as a lesson,

19:17.481 --> 19:19.080
and let it always

19:19.161 --> 19:20.280
serve as a reminder.

19:20.710 --> 19:21.604
(Yu Residence)

19:21.721 --> 19:23.681
(By the grace of Heaven,)

19:23.681 --> 19:24.560
(the Emperor decrees:)

19:24.921 --> 19:25.760
(Yu Guodong,)

19:25.760 --> 19:26.881
(Yu Residence)
(guilty of heinous crimes,)

19:27.201 --> 19:27.800
(now)

19:27.800 --> 19:29.001
(stands convicted of multiple offenses.)

19:29.161 --> 19:30.241
(His assets are confiscated)

19:30.481 --> 19:31.560
(and forfeited to the treasury.)

19:32.080 --> 19:33.481
(His son, Yu Jingxiu,)

19:33.560 --> 19:34.840
(and wife, Shu,)

19:34.840 --> 19:35.961
(for their role in exposing the crimes,)

19:36.241 --> 19:37.600
(are granted a pardon)

19:37.800 --> 19:38.961
(but reduced to commoners.)

19:39.441 --> 19:40.641
(All other servants)

19:40.760 --> 19:42.800
(May Virtue and Grace Endure)
(are to be banished
fifteen hundred kilometers.)

19:43.080 --> 19:44.360
(Thus decreed.)

19:45.800 --> 19:46.201
(Yu Residence)
Move out.

20:27.520 --> 20:30.040
Now it's your turn to laugh at me.

20:31.040 --> 20:33.080
What's in that box?

20:37.040 --> 20:38.961
The recipe for Chastity Tonic?

20:44.120 --> 20:45.681
It's my mother's keepsake.

20:49.241 --> 20:50.600
I want her

20:52.320 --> 20:53.520
to bear witness.

20:57.760 --> 20:58.961
About the Fifth Madam's matter,

21:01.161 --> 21:02.840
I owe you an apology.

21:03.360 --> 21:04.641
But for other things,

21:06.120 --> 21:07.840
we traded blow for blow.

21:08.961 --> 21:11.080
I see no fault in my actions.

21:11.760 --> 21:13.921
Since ancient times, the victor rules.

21:14.641 --> 21:16.481
Now that I have lost,

21:17.881 --> 21:19.600
I am at your mercy.

21:21.280 --> 21:23.161
Have you come to take my life?

21:26.320 --> 21:27.760
I like to think

21:29.800 --> 21:31.241
I know you well.

21:33.201 --> 21:34.840
You are not afraid of death.

21:36.520 --> 21:37.520
What you fear

21:38.600 --> 21:40.320
is losing that last shred of pride.

21:42.921 --> 21:44.520
Living with nothing left

21:44.520 --> 21:45.760
would be worse

21:46.560 --> 21:47.481
than death itself.

21:59.881 --> 22:01.360
Between you and me,

22:02.120 --> 22:03.120
we're each other's teachers,

22:03.800 --> 22:04.840
rivals,

22:05.760 --> 22:06.881
and friends.

22:09.721 --> 22:11.360
We never became
mother-in-law and daughter-in-law,

22:12.040 --> 22:13.560
but we turned out to be kindred spirits.

22:15.080 --> 22:17.040
That is quite interesting.

22:18.080 --> 22:19.360
There is a touch of loneliness

22:20.401 --> 22:21.560
in your words.

22:22.800 --> 22:24.080
In this world,

22:25.280 --> 22:26.921
who is not lonely?

22:30.641 --> 22:32.560
Have you ever thought

22:33.560 --> 22:34.921
about what kind of person
you want to become?

22:38.280 --> 22:39.280
When I was young,

22:41.280 --> 22:43.201
I once took you as my role model.

22:43.520 --> 22:44.641
I thought a woman

22:44.961 --> 22:46.280
should be like you,

22:46.600 --> 22:47.881
running the household,

22:48.320 --> 22:49.600
knowing when to advance
and when to retreat,

22:49.881 --> 22:51.320
and even taking charge

22:51.320 --> 22:52.320
among men.

22:54.721 --> 22:55.760
And then?

22:58.241 --> 22:59.721
Then I understood.

23:00.560 --> 23:01.840
Even you, Madam,

23:02.280 --> 23:03.280
are nothing more

23:04.040 --> 23:05.360
than a proxy for men's power,

23:05.760 --> 23:06.881
an ornament

23:06.881 --> 23:08.080
to their glory.

23:13.600 --> 23:15.441
Today, I have come to thank you.

23:16.721 --> 23:18.040
Thank you for shattering

23:18.040 --> 23:19.320
my illusions back then.

23:20.001 --> 23:21.921
You kept me
from repeating your mistakes.

23:32.800 --> 23:33.921
Your words...

23:35.080 --> 23:36.840
If I had a child like you,

23:37.520 --> 23:39.681
perhaps I would better understand them.

23:49.401 --> 23:51.040
If I were your daughter,

23:51.921 --> 23:53.800
you would still be dissatisfied with me.

23:54.800 --> 23:56.161
Your way of thinking

23:57.840 --> 23:59.641
and acting would be just the same.

24:27.520 --> 24:28.320
Madam.

24:29.360 --> 24:30.360
Madam!

24:32.001 --> 24:33.040
Madam!

24:33.961 --> 24:36.360
I can no longer care for you!

24:36.641 --> 24:39.881
I cannot bear to leave you, Madam!

24:40.800 --> 24:43.360
Take care, Madam!

26:05.560 --> 26:06.401
This is

26:09.921 --> 26:10.881
for Ji.

26:16.881 --> 26:18.161
Your family assets have been seized.

26:19.161 --> 26:20.800
Now you must care for your mother

26:21.441 --> 26:22.481
and raise your child.

26:24.721 --> 26:27.120
My wife sends this on behalf of Fan.

26:33.641 --> 26:35.241
Are you here to humiliate me?

26:38.600 --> 26:39.961
If you see kindness

26:39.961 --> 26:41.001
as humiliation,

26:41.881 --> 26:42.800
then yes.

26:45.040 --> 26:46.241
I am humiliating you.

26:48.120 --> 26:49.080
But in this world,

26:49.080 --> 26:50.641
who has never been humiliated?

26:52.360 --> 26:54.481
Just think of it as walking
a path others have walked.

27:01.921 --> 27:03.441
If you cannot even bear this,

27:06.401 --> 27:07.641
you might as well

27:07.641 --> 27:08.840
return Ji to his mother.

27:38.637 --> 27:40.540
(Yu Residence)

27:51.401 --> 27:53.241
Yu Guodong has been brought down.

27:53.241 --> 27:54.401
I am greatly pleased.

27:54.681 --> 27:57.600
I hereby confer upon Zhao Ling
the honorary Third‑Rank General Zhaoyi

27:58.001 --> 27:59.001
and bestow an imperial patent,

27:59.280 --> 28:00.320
along with a new residence.

28:12.320 --> 28:13.481
Your Majesty,
please consider this carefully.

28:14.441 --> 28:15.520
I beg your forgiveness,

28:17.921 --> 28:19.161
but I cannot accept.

28:26.360 --> 28:28.040
You refuse my rewards,

28:28.840 --> 28:30.241
and now you wish to resign?

28:31.681 --> 28:33.001
Do you think I have no one else

28:33.080 --> 28:34.360
to serve me in this court?

28:35.760 --> 28:36.840
Your Majesty, please calm yourself.

28:37.721 --> 28:39.760
I was once nothing but an outlaw.

28:40.360 --> 28:41.881
By Your Majesty's boundless grace,

28:42.600 --> 28:44.560
I was elevated to the court.

28:48.080 --> 28:49.360
But the court is a place

28:50.681 --> 28:51.840
where one treads on thin ice.

28:53.881 --> 28:55.201
I have struggled to navigate

28:56.520 --> 28:57.921
and often felt inadequate.

29:00.681 --> 29:02.161
At times, I was drawn into conflicts

29:03.721 --> 29:05.721
that harmed the very people
I wished to protect.

29:09.641 --> 29:11.641
I never had grand ambitions.

29:11.881 --> 29:13.040
All I have ever wanted

29:14.201 --> 29:15.040
is

29:15.161 --> 29:16.401
to be with the one I love,

29:17.120 --> 29:18.320
watching the days pass

29:19.040 --> 29:20.161
and growing old in peace.

29:21.401 --> 29:23.001
There are many worthy ministers

29:24.280 --> 29:25.681
who can serve as wise counselors.

29:26.201 --> 29:27.600
They will understand
the affairs of state

29:27.961 --> 29:29.120
and help build a prosperous era.

29:31.080 --> 29:31.881
I

29:36.481 --> 29:37.120
humbly

29:38.320 --> 29:39.760
ask for Your Majesty's grace.

29:40.441 --> 29:41.360
Please grant me permission

29:42.080 --> 29:43.201
to retire from service

29:45.721 --> 29:46.800
and fulfill this one wish.

29:53.280 --> 29:54.080
You may step out.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.161
All right.

30:15.641 --> 30:16.881
Your heart is not in this.

30:17.241 --> 30:18.800
No matter how I try to keep you,

30:19.001 --> 30:20.161
it would be in vain.

30:34.441 --> 30:35.921
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

30:54.201 --> 30:55.040
You may go.

31:19.120 --> 31:21.161
Madam Wei, how did you win again?

31:21.280 --> 31:22.760
How do you win every round?

31:22.760 --> 31:23.961
Exactly.

31:24.721 --> 31:25.600
Go and prepare.

31:25.681 --> 31:26.201
Yes.

31:26.401 --> 31:27.840
I feel like switching seats with you.

31:27.840 --> 31:29.360
It's not about the seat.

31:30.641 --> 31:31.201
Madam,

31:32.320 --> 31:33.360
Master has returned.

31:35.161 --> 31:36.881
He even changed into fresh clothes.

31:40.441 --> 31:41.560
Let's stop here.

31:41.560 --> 31:42.681
It's getting late.

31:42.921 --> 31:43.760
Then

31:44.040 --> 31:45.080
shall we meet another day?

31:45.520 --> 31:46.201
Sure.

31:46.280 --> 31:47.080
Another day.

31:57.481 --> 31:58.961
This lady here,

31:59.201 --> 32:00.201
are you

32:00.201 --> 32:02.001
waiting for your husband?

32:11.080 --> 32:12.241
I wonder,

32:12.241 --> 32:13.921
how was your luck today?

32:15.840 --> 32:18.201
Luck in gambling
means less luck in love.

32:18.800 --> 32:20.241
I kept winning today.

32:20.241 --> 32:21.201
What do you think?

32:24.001 --> 32:24.520
Come on.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.520
Sit here.

32:25.600 --> 32:26.161
Good.

32:27.320 --> 32:28.280
Come on.

32:29.840 --> 32:30.881
Let me

32:31.201 --> 32:32.161
rub it for you.

32:35.760 --> 32:37.241
Were you the one

32:37.360 --> 32:39.201
who helped me with the recent matter?

32:41.320 --> 32:42.800
Who doesn't know

32:42.800 --> 32:44.161
about the things you've been doing?

32:51.040 --> 32:51.760
But

32:51.760 --> 32:53.080
I already had Father

32:53.080 --> 32:54.241
pull your name list

32:54.241 --> 32:55.201
out of the pile.

32:56.080 --> 32:56.721
Really?

33:13.800 --> 33:14.600
Move.

33:16.760 --> 33:17.721
Madam,

33:17.721 --> 33:19.681
you are too good to me.

33:20.320 --> 33:22.320
Then you know what to do from now on?

33:23.120 --> 33:25.280
I'll be good and listen to you.

33:27.963 --> 33:28.729
(Xianji Salt Shop)

33:28.760 --> 33:30.040
Fine salt,
twenty copper coins per catty.

33:30.600 --> 33:31.481
Come again.

33:31.481 --> 33:31.921
Sure.

33:32.320 --> 33:33.120
Sir,

33:33.201 --> 33:34.401
has the salt reform

33:34.401 --> 33:35.360
really been settled?

33:35.360 --> 33:36.401
The court gazette

33:36.401 --> 33:37.320
came down yesterday.

33:37.481 --> 33:38.681
From now on, the salt

33:38.681 --> 33:40.560
will no longer be controlled
by one family alone.

33:40.961 --> 33:41.641
Alright.

33:42.360 --> 33:43.840
Fine salt, twenty copper coins

33:43.840 --> 33:44.360
per catty.

33:44.360 --> 33:45.681
Just a while ago,

33:45.681 --> 33:47.241
fine salt was seventy
or eighty copper coins per catty.

33:47.401 --> 33:48.241
(Xianji Salt Shop)
Now,

33:48.360 --> 33:49.681
you can buy it for twenty.

33:50.080 --> 33:51.241
With the Yu family's fall,

33:51.241 --> 33:52.481
and the salt administration cleansed,

33:52.481 --> 33:53.481
our lives

33:53.481 --> 33:54.481
are getting better.

33:54.481 --> 33:55.080
Indeed.

33:55.103 --> 33:56.303
(Double Happiness)

34:33.841 --> 34:34.801
Thank you for your hospitality,
Commander Wang.

34:34.801 --> 34:36.001
(Double Happiness)
Thank you, Commander Wang.

34:36.001 --> 34:36.321
Come on.

34:37.361 --> 34:38.801
I'm glad you could come.

34:39.001 --> 34:39.560
Go on home now.

34:39.640 --> 34:40.801
Alright.

34:41.801 --> 34:42.680
Let's go.

34:43.321 --> 34:44.160
Easy.

34:47.401 --> 34:48.560
My dear,

34:48.560 --> 34:50.961
do you remember the persimmon tree

34:51.361 --> 34:53.680
planted in the backyard
after we married?

34:54.921 --> 34:56.321
Of course I do.

34:58.361 --> 34:59.481
You once said to learn

34:59.481 --> 35:00.720
from the persimmon.

35:01.040 --> 35:02.200
The more it endures the frost,

35:02.481 --> 35:03.281
the sweeter it becomes.

35:04.441 --> 35:05.281
Wrong,

35:05.841 --> 35:07.080
I was wrong.

35:08.801 --> 35:10.321
(Double Happiness)
Look at the persimmon.

35:10.481 --> 35:12.640
When fully ripe, it falls to the ground.

35:13.120 --> 35:15.080
It never clings to the branch.

35:17.001 --> 35:18.080
So

35:18.560 --> 35:21.321
the persimmon's worth
is not in its sweetness,

35:23.321 --> 35:24.761
but in its falling.

35:30.240 --> 35:31.720
To fall and to rise again

35:31.921 --> 35:33.080
is nature's way.

35:36.200 --> 35:37.560
This is to you

35:37.720 --> 35:39.040
and a broad state of mind.

35:39.801 --> 35:41.040
To you, Madam.

35:42.800 --> 35:46.720
(Double Happiness)

35:52.560 --> 35:54.921
When the Yu family fell,
everyone scattered.

35:55.120 --> 35:56.321
I haven't heard

35:56.321 --> 35:58.560
what happened to that Young Madam Yu.

35:58.881 --> 36:00.040
Could she have

36:00.520 --> 36:02.841
quietly died in some well?

36:03.680 --> 36:04.801
I heard,

36:04.801 --> 36:06.160
before the Yu family fell,

36:06.160 --> 36:08.120
she was sent off to the estate.

36:08.281 --> 36:10.441
Even if she hasn't been punished,

36:11.001 --> 36:12.160
she's probably

36:12.881 --> 36:14.401
out there working the fields.

36:15.080 --> 36:16.560
Wasn't she the one who compiled

36:16.560 --> 36:18.120
the Dongshan Poetry Talks,

36:18.120 --> 36:19.680
the talented Fan Yake?

36:20.080 --> 36:21.001
That's her.

36:21.361 --> 36:22.801
That book you mentioned

36:23.080 --> 36:25.240
people only bought it to prop up a table

36:25.361 --> 36:27.441
when the Yu family was powerful.

36:28.441 --> 36:29.520
That's not right.

36:32.120 --> 36:34.001
Fan Yake may have married
into the Yu family,

36:34.281 --> 36:35.600
but she came from Huaying.

36:36.001 --> 36:37.841
She is the daughter of the great scholar
Fan Kun.

36:38.441 --> 36:39.720
She excels in painting,

36:39.881 --> 36:41.080
capturing flowers and plants
with such life,

36:41.520 --> 36:43.720
and her poetry is exquisite.

36:44.120 --> 36:45.240
What does her talent

36:45.520 --> 36:46.720
have to do with the Yu family?

36:50.801 --> 36:51.841
This person

36:52.200 --> 36:53.321
looks familiar.

36:54.481 --> 36:55.361
Could she be

36:55.361 --> 36:56.401
Fan?

37:08.160 --> 37:08.961
My Lady,

37:09.040 --> 37:10.961
the new shipment of brocade has arrived.

37:10.961 --> 37:12.761
They're waiting for you
to check and shelve it.

37:13.801 --> 37:15.001
I never imagined

37:15.361 --> 37:16.321
I would ever live

37:16.321 --> 37:17.560
a life like this.

37:17.881 --> 37:18.680
With leisure,

37:18.761 --> 37:19.520
and with money.

37:20.160 --> 37:20.761
Let's go.

37:23.530 --> 37:24.896
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Brother
Yang Yucheng)

37:24.896 --> 37:26.304
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Mother Yang)

37:26.309 --> 37:27.890
(Spirit Tablet of My Late Brother
Zhou Ruixiang)

37:39.640 --> 37:43.281
- Mr. Jin.

37:45.921 --> 37:46.961
Take a look at this.

37:47.080 --> 37:47.720
Mr. Jin.

37:49.361 --> 37:50.001
Here you go.

37:50.520 --> 37:51.281
Thank you.

37:52.200 --> 37:52.720
Thank you.

37:53.240 --> 37:53.761
Take care.

37:58.481 --> 38:00.281
Why is Mr. Jin limping?

38:01.080 --> 38:02.060
(Xie's Shop  Cliff Salt)
In the seventh year of Hongzhi,

38:02.060 --> 38:03.200
(Xie's Shop  Cliff Salt)
a corrupt official was brought down.

38:03.200 --> 38:04.240
Have you heard of it?

38:04.921 --> 38:06.321
Mr. Jin beat the Dengwen Drum.

38:06.321 --> 38:07.401
He sacrificed a leg,

38:07.401 --> 38:08.361
but he did right by his brothers.

38:10.841 --> 38:12.200
His salt is quite good.

38:24.040 --> 38:25.640
Congratulations, Madam Mo.

38:25.801 --> 38:26.720
Madam Mo.

38:26.720 --> 38:27.640
Madam Mo, congratulations.

38:27.640 --> 38:29.001
Congratulations.

38:29.001 --> 38:29.801
Congrats on your son's success.

38:29.801 --> 38:30.720
I'm so happy.

38:30.720 --> 38:31.321
Congratulations.

38:31.321 --> 38:32.120
Congrats.

38:32.120 --> 38:33.040
Congratulations.

38:36.881 --> 38:38.401
Thank you, everyone.

38:39.720 --> 38:40.961
I always knew

38:41.200 --> 38:42.321
the Mo family

38:43.040 --> 38:44.801
would produce a scholar.

38:46.240 --> 38:48.281
Congratulations.

38:48.361 --> 38:48.881
Congratulations.

38:48.881 --> 38:50.321
Congratulations to Young Master Mo.

38:51.761 --> 38:53.401
Why are you crying over good news?

38:53.401 --> 38:54.560
I'm happy.

38:54.680 --> 38:55.801
Alright.

38:55.801 --> 38:56.961
It's great news.

38:59.695 --> 39:01.360
(Zhengxue Academy)

39:01.841 --> 39:02.680
Master!

39:03.481 --> 39:04.240
Master!

39:04.240 --> 39:05.120
I passed!

39:05.401 --> 39:06.080
Master.

39:06.200 --> 39:06.560
Master.

39:06.560 --> 39:07.080
I passed too!

39:07.080 --> 39:08.040
We all passed!

39:11.600 --> 39:12.160
Good.

39:12.680 --> 39:13.200
Good.

39:14.120 --> 39:15.560
Remember what I have taught you.

39:16.560 --> 39:17.481
As officials,

39:18.080 --> 39:19.321
you must be incorruptible and just,

39:19.321 --> 39:20.321
and love the people as your own.

39:20.520 --> 39:22.281
Do not be blinded by wealth

39:22.881 --> 39:24.001
and lose sight of your true purpose.

39:24.281 --> 39:25.120
Heaven

39:25.321 --> 39:27.001
has opened countless paths for us.

39:27.441 --> 39:28.921
Choose wisely.

39:29.801 --> 39:32.240
Thank you, Master, for your guidance.

39:36.640 --> 39:37.761
Master.

39:40.841 --> 39:41.841
You see?

39:42.040 --> 39:43.080
I am not

39:43.080 --> 39:44.240
without talent for learning.

39:44.680 --> 39:46.441
I just didn't like the imperial exams.

39:47.080 --> 39:47.801
I think

39:48.281 --> 39:49.200
teaching is good.

39:49.401 --> 39:50.600
Yes.

39:50.600 --> 39:51.720
Our master

39:51.801 --> 39:52.921
is the best.

39:53.841 --> 39:54.640
Senior brother,

39:54.640 --> 39:55.441
congratulations on passing.

39:55.441 --> 39:56.761
We should thank Master Fu.

40:00.019 --> 40:02.166
(Letter-Writing Service)

40:04.361 --> 40:05.240
Need a letter written?

40:09.321 --> 40:09.961
Sir,

40:10.481 --> 40:11.441
need a letter written?

40:11.720 --> 40:12.600
I heard

40:12.600 --> 40:13.761
you were a top scholar.

40:14.361 --> 40:15.200
So

40:15.200 --> 40:16.321
do you still charge

40:16.321 --> 40:18.120
just three copper coins per letter?

40:18.401 --> 40:19.841
He's the son of a convicted official.

40:19.841 --> 40:21.560
It's generous enough

40:21.560 --> 40:22.520
that he gets any business.

40:23.321 --> 40:24.001
Yes.

40:25.040 --> 40:26.321
I write and copy

40:26.321 --> 40:27.240
at the market rate,

40:27.240 --> 40:28.080
three copper coins per letter,

40:28.080 --> 40:28.801
no matter how long.

40:29.961 --> 40:30.761
Ji,

40:30.921 --> 40:31.720
look,

40:32.520 --> 40:34.761
this is the character for top scholar.

40:37.080 --> 40:39.160
Study hard,

40:39.361 --> 40:40.761
and one day, like your father,

40:40.921 --> 40:42.200
you will top all three exams

40:43.040 --> 40:44.361
and bring honor to the family.

40:47.720 --> 40:48.841
Listen to me.

40:49.281 --> 40:50.401
No matter what happens,

40:50.401 --> 40:51.720
no matter when,

40:52.600 --> 40:54.160
you must never lose your spirit.

40:54.640 --> 40:55.720
Do you remember?

40:57.560 --> 40:58.321
Remember?

40:59.240 --> 41:01.680
The old lady looks good.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.560
Yes.

41:02.560 --> 41:04.120
She teaches her grandson every day.

41:04.321 --> 41:05.841
She wants him to be a top scholar.

41:06.401 --> 41:07.600
But her family ran afoul of the law.

41:07.801 --> 41:09.600
For generations to come, none of them
can sit for the exams.

41:09.841 --> 41:10.961
Is that true?

41:14.361 --> 41:15.321
Greetings, ladies.

41:18.881 --> 41:19.720
Stop staring.

41:19.720 --> 41:20.401
Let's go.

41:23.841 --> 41:25.321
Jingxiu, you're back.

41:25.520 --> 41:26.080
Mother.

41:27.200 --> 41:27.761
Come here.

41:33.921 --> 41:34.680
Jingxiu,

41:35.001 --> 41:37.120
I have found a match for you.

41:37.881 --> 41:39.841
Though the family is not prominent,

41:40.680 --> 41:42.040
the Ninth Young Lady Fu

41:43.160 --> 41:44.720
is one I favor.

41:49.921 --> 41:51.520
Listen to your mother.

41:51.680 --> 41:53.080
A virtuous woman
blesses three generations.

41:53.680 --> 41:54.560
In marriage,

41:55.001 --> 41:56.080
choose virtue.

42:03.040 --> 42:04.160
I will do as you say.

42:08.080 --> 42:09.361
And you must remember too.

42:10.120 --> 42:11.801
When you grow up,

42:13.040 --> 42:15.560
your father will find you a good match.

42:16.600 --> 42:18.160
A virtuous woman
blesses three generations.

42:18.560 --> 42:19.560
In marriage,

42:20.560 --> 42:21.680
choose virtue.

42:22.841 --> 42:23.921
Be like your father...

42:23.921 --> 42:24.841
I will do as you say.

42:25.921 --> 42:27.361
You will top all three exams

42:27.361 --> 42:28.200
and bring honor to the family.

42:28.200 --> 42:29.200
I will do as you say.

42:29.961 --> 42:31.441
When he grows up,

42:31.841 --> 42:33.680
he must also find a good match.

42:34.401 --> 42:35.881
A virtuous woman
blesses three generations.

42:36.441 --> 42:37.441
In marriage,

42:37.600 --> 42:38.801
choose virtue.

42:43.281 --> 42:47.401
The wise delight in water,
the virtuous delight in mountains.

42:47.401 --> 42:48.640
The wise are active,

42:49.080 --> 42:50.401
the virtuous are still.

42:51.401 --> 42:52.801
The wise find joy,

42:53.401 --> 42:54.881
the virtuous live long.

42:56.841 --> 42:57.921
(I never expected)

42:58.520 --> 43:00.361
(that she could now settle her mind)

43:01.321 --> 43:03.160
(in this remote place as an instructor.)

43:04.761 --> 43:06.001
(From Miss Fan)

43:06.001 --> 43:07.200
(to Young Madam Yu)

43:07.921 --> 43:09.640
(to now Ms. Fan, the instructor.)

43:10.841 --> 43:11.761
(Perhaps)

43:12.720 --> 43:14.441
(this is who she truly is.)

43:15.640 --> 43:16.640
Mother,

43:16.640 --> 43:18.001
where is this?

43:19.281 --> 43:20.401
This is where

43:20.401 --> 43:21.921
I used to teach.

43:22.801 --> 43:24.080
And where your father

43:24.361 --> 43:25.841
made his name.

43:26.160 --> 43:28.120
Teach me to read and write, Mother.

43:28.120 --> 43:30.001
One day, I'll make my mark too,

43:30.001 --> 43:31.321
and be remembered.

43:32.321 --> 43:34.001
You, what do you want to be
when you grow up?

43:34.961 --> 43:36.401
I want to be like you, Father,

43:36.520 --> 43:38.160
a general, a high official.

43:39.160 --> 43:39.600
Come on.

43:39.921 --> 43:40.401
Careful.

43:40.401 --> 43:42.281
Becoming a regional commander is good.

43:44.001 --> 43:45.921
But the three of us,

43:47.281 --> 43:49.281
living freely,

43:49.401 --> 43:50.401
is also good.

43:51.441 --> 43:53.361
To transcend the world,
you must first enter it.

43:56.801 --> 43:58.160
You, when you grow up,

43:58.560 --> 44:00.321
if you can be like your mother,

44:02.001 --> 44:03.200
with a mind of her own,

44:04.441 --> 44:05.961
even if you're not in the history books,

44:06.361 --> 44:07.720
you'll still be a remarkable woman.

44:24.307 --> 44:29.320
♪Once a bird in a cage,
longing for the boundless sky♪

44:30.647 --> 44:36.040
♪To break through a thousand barriers
and cast off a life of illusion♪

44:37.114 --> 44:40.867
♪Though I rack my brain with care,
fate still sways me here and there♪

44:40.881 --> 44:41.720
Hold on tight.

44:42.680 --> 44:43.361
Hold steady.

44:44.520 --> 44:45.761
Sit tight, You.

44:45.961 --> 44:46.801
Okay.

44:46.801 --> 44:48.080
Let's go.

44:49.441 --> 44:50.961
Father, higher!

44:51.080 --> 44:52.441
Higher!

44:52.441 --> 44:53.520
Alright.

44:56.446 --> 45:01.800
♪Inviting frost to my temples,
veiling the face of bygone days.♪

45:02.610 --> 45:08.604
♪Bearing wings through stormy tides,
wash away stain of false accusation♪

45:09.165 --> 45:15.240
♪May all common folk share one roof,
every lantern rest in peace♪

45:15.483 --> 45:20.840
♪Let this humble name carry me
through a life adrift♪

45:21.917 --> 45:27.040
♪With wit and strategy,
I enter this game without regret♪

45:27.857 --> 45:30.700
♪Though each move is forced upon me♪

45:30.790 --> 45:35.123
♪May it buy the world
one moment's peace from the storm♪

45:35.302 --> 45:38.857
♪I crave no clarity♪

45:40.475 --> 45:43.172
♪From outside my soul♪
(Directed by Deng Ke)

45:46.446 --> 45:48.046
(The End)

46:02.680 --> 46:07.000
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

46:10.600 --> 46:14.960
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

46:17.080 --> 46:21.720
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

46:21.960 --> 46:24.760
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

46:25.920 --> 46:30.560
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

46:33.760 --> 46:40.600
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

46:41.480 --> 46:48.000
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

46:48.960 --> 46:52.400
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:52.920 --> 46:57.120
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:57.400 --> 47:03.080
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

47:15.200 --> 47:19.080
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

47:23.000 --> 47:27.000
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

47:28.720 --> 47:33.400
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

47:33.720 --> 47:36.400
♪Kept close within my heart♪

47:37.480 --> 47:42.320
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

47:45.840 --> 47:52.760
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

47:53.640 --> 48:00.120
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

48:01.000 --> 48:04.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

48:04.960 --> 48:09.320
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

48:09.520 --> 48:15.240
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
